INT. APARTMENT KITCHEN - NIGHT

The kitchen is dark. Only the fridge glows. THEO tiptoes in, socks on tile.

Theo eases the door open. Two cartoon eyes blink awake on the fridge's screen.

FRIDGE
Good evening, Theo. It is two fourteen a.m.

FRIDGE
Your goal this month is "eat more vegetables."
Shall I read it back to you?

THEO
I'm just getting water.

FRIDGE
The water is in the door. Your hand is on the cheesecake.

The ceiling light snaps on. NINA stands in the doorway, arms crossed.

NINA
Theo.

THEO
It started it.

NINA
Fridge. Lock the cheesecake.

FRIDGE
Cheesecake secured.
Also, Nina, your ice cream is behind the frozen peas.

Nina freezes. Theo turns, very slowly.

THEO
Behind... the peas?

SMASH CUT TO:

Nina and Theo sit on the floor by the open fridge, sharing the cheesecake and the ice cream.

FRIDGE
I will be informing the scale.

> FADE OUT.
